      "headline": {
        "en": "Blue Owl lifts revolver commitment to $3.225bn and extends maturity to 2031",
        "zh": "Blue Owl将循环信贷承诺提高至32.25亿美元，并将到期日延长至2031年"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "On October 14, 2026, Blue Owl Finance LLC, an indirect subsidiary of Blue Owl Capital Inc., and several Blue Owl guarantor entities entered a Fourth Amendment to their June 15, 2022 credit agreement with MUFG Bank, Ltd. as administrative agent and the lenders party thereto. The amendment increased the revolving credit commitment to a total new commitment of $3,225,000,000, subject to a potential increase to $3,870,000,000 if certain conditions are met, reduced the applicable margin and commitment fee rate, and extended the facility maturity to October 14, 2031.",
        "zh": "2026年10月14日，Blue Owl Capital Inc.的间接子公司Blue Owl Finance LLC与多家Blue Owl担保实体，与作为行政代理人的MUFG Bank, Ltd.及协议各贷款方签署了其2022年6月15日信贷协议的第四修正案。该修正案将循环信贷承诺总额提高至3,225,000,000美元，并在满足特定条件后可能进一步增至3,870,000,000美元，同时下调了适用利率和承诺费率，并将该融资工具的到期日延长至2031年10月14日。"
      },
      "gps": [
