        "en": "Victory Park Capital launched the AltsABF Tokenized Feeder Fund (VALTS), offering US investors tokenised access to the Privacore VPC Asset Backed Credit Fund (AltsABF), a non-listed closed-end interval fund launched in January 2026. VPC partnered with Tradable, which has tokenised $3bn in private credit, and VALTS is available on the Stellar blockchain network. It expects quarterly liquidity and monthly income distributions in stablecoin.",
